### 1. Create Product 1 (Electronics)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "RGB Backlit Blue Switch",
  "price": 79.99,
  "category": "Electronics"
}

### 2. Create Product 2 (Kitchen)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ceramic Coffee Mug",
  "description": "350ml heat resistant ceramic mug",
  "price": 14.50,
  "category": "Kitchen"
}

### 3. Create Product 3 (Electronics)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "description": "Ergonomic 2.4GHz optical mouse",
  "price": 29.99,
  "category": "Electronics"
}

### 4. Get All Products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Product By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 6. Filter by Category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/category/Electronics
Accept: application/json

### 7. Filter by Max Price (<= 50.0)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/price/50.0
Accept: application/json

### 8. Search Products by Name (Case-Insensitive)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/search?name=mouse
Accept: application/json

### 9. Update Product
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard Pro",
  "description": "RGB Backlit Silent Red Switch",
  "price": 89.99,
  "category": "Electronics"
}

### 10. Delete Product By ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/2
